From af6692dffd1b6ec7958de29826be1d0b7bad23ee Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 14:21:35 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] ADD selected-agent slash command routing through backend
 hooks

Selected-agent chat input whose first token is slash-prefixed uses the provider command hook instead of the normal prompt path. The neutral AgentBackend hook keeps the command surface provider-agnostic, while Codex executes the raw command against the existing app-server thread and the controller test verifies slash commands do not consume ordinary send turns.
